    ".travel-section": "<div class=\"section-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">The journey</span><h2 id=\"travel-title\">Get there your way</h2></div><div class=\"mode-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Travel mode\"><button data-mode=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\" type=\"button\">Compare both</button><button data-mode=\"road\" aria-pressed=\"false\" type=\"button\">By road</button><button data-mode=\"rail\" aria-pressed=\"false\" type=\"button\">By rail</button></div></div><div class=\"travel-grid\"><article class=\"panel travel-card\" id=\"road-card\"><span class=\"number\">01 / ROAD</span><h3>Into Somerset</h3><p class=\"lead\">Use <strong>BS39 7RF</strong> for Winterfield Stadium.</p><p>Approach Paulton via the A37 / A362 towards Radstock, then follow local signs for Winterfield Road. Check live traffic and the final approach before travelling.</p><form id=\"road-form\"><label for=\"origin\">Starting town or postcode</label><div class=\"input-action\"><input id=\"origin\" maxlength=\"120\" name=\"origin\" value=\"Tiverton, Devon\" autocomplete=\"off\"/><button class=\"button dark\" type=\"submit\">Update route</button></div></form><div class=\"actions\"><a id=\"drive-link\" class=\"button yellow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Tiverton%2C%20Devon&amp;destination=Winterfield%20Stadium%2C%20Paulton%20BS39%207RF&amp;travelmode=driving\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open live directions ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.paultonrovers.co.uk/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Club location ↗</a></div><div class=\"mini-note\"><strong>Parking and arrival</strong><p>Check available spaces, charges, accessible parking and any match-specific arrangements with Paulton Rovers FC. Do not assume parking is guaranteed.</p></div><details><summary>Work out a departure time</summary><p class=\"source-line\">Your planning allowance, not a live traffic estimate.</p><div class=\"planning-inputs\"><label>Arrive at ground<input